"""
TRUSTNET V5 HEAVY DATA
Cyber Fraud Intelligence & Money-Tracing Platform

Single-file Flask prototype.

Install (Linux/macOS):
    python3 -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    python -m pip install Flask pandas openpyxl pypdf pdfplumber PyMuPDF pillow pytesseract python-pptx python-docx reportlab

Optional OS tools for legacy Office files / OCR:
    LibreOffice (soffice), tesseract

Run:
    python trustnet.py

Then open:
    http://127.0.0.1:5090

Notes:
- 8 GB PER FILE upload cap; CSV/PDF/ZIP datasets use disk-backed streaming.
- ZIP bundles can contain PDF/CSV/JSON shards and are processed member-by-member.
- Large datasets stay on disk; only a bounded analytical window is loaded into RAM.
- Uploaded investigation data is processed locally; it is not sent to a model/API.
- Freeze is SIMULATION ONLY; no bank/API action is performed.
- Risk labels are computed from evidence present in the dataset.
- Missing values are shown as NOT AVAILABLE; no fake identifiers are generated.
"""

